{"id":"beleza","lemma":"beleza","pos":"noun","rank":569,"glosses":["beauty (the condition of being beautiful)","beauty (a beautiful thing or person)"],"ipa":"/beˈle.zɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/20/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-beleza.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-beleza.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"belezas"},"examples":[{"text":"Não faça isso, beleza?","en":"Don't do that, OK?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/476004","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"Beleza, cara?","en":"What's up, dude?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/80062","words":[null,{"g":"guy, dude"}]},{"text":"A beleza é subjetiva.","en":"Beauty is subjective.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/856700","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"subjective","l":"subjetivo"}]},{"text":"A verdade é mais importante do que a beleza.","en":"Truth is more important than beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264335","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"truth"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"important"},null,null,{"g":"the / to"},null],"phrases":[[5,7,"than"]]},{"text":"A beleza está nos olhos de quem vê.","en":"Beauty is in the eye of the beholder.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"us","l":"nós"},{"g":"eye","l":"olho"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to see","l":"ver"}]}]}